---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description={`About ${SITE.author}`}>
  <section class="wrap about">
    <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
    <h1>Real moments. Beautiful places. Photographs worth remembering.</h1>

    <p>
      Hi, I&rsquo;m a Portland, Oregon photographer with a passion for finding the story in a
      moment — whether that&rsquo;s a quiet landscape beneath the stars, a joyful family
      gathering, a curious pet, or the energy of a special event.
    </p>
    <p>
      I fell in love with photography because a photograph can do something incredible: it can
      bring you back to a moment you thought had already passed.
    </p>
    <p>That idea guides everything I photograph.</p>
    <p>
      I enjoy working across a wide range of subjects, including portraits, social events, pets,
      nature and landscapes, astrophotography, aviation, food, and everyday moments. Each one
      gives me a different opportunity to look at the world differently and capture something
      authentic.
    </p>

    <h2>Photography with curiosity behind it</h2>
    <p>
      I&rsquo;m constantly exploring Portland and the Pacific Northwest with a camera nearby,
      looking for interesting light, unexpected perspectives, and those fleeting moments that
      might otherwise go unnoticed.
    </p>
    <p>
      From dramatic Oregon skies and mountain landscapes to the personality of a beloved pet, the
      atmosphere of an event, or the details that make a place memorable, I&rsquo;m interested in
      photographs that feel genuine, engaging, and alive.
    </p>
    <p>My goal isn&rsquo;t simply to take a technically good photograph.</p>
    <p>It&rsquo;s to create an image that makes you stop, feel something, and remember.</p>

    <h2>Let&rsquo;s create something together</h2>
    <p>
      Whether you&rsquo;re looking for photographs of an event, portraits that actually feel like
      you, memorable images of your pets, photographs for your business or social media, or
      simply someone who sees the world a little differently through a camera, I&rsquo;d love to
      hear your idea.
    </p>
    <p>
      I&rsquo;m based in Portland, Oregon and am always interested in meeting new people,
      exploring new places, and taking on creative projects.
    </p>
    <p>Have something in mind? Let&rsquo;s talk.</p>

    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact/">Get in Touch</a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .about {
    padding-block: var(--space-5);
    max-width: 700px;
  }

  .about h1 {
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.6rem);
  }

  .about h2 {
    margin-top: var(--space-4);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
  }

  .about .btn {
    margin-top: var(--space-2);
  }
</style>
